IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. OCCURS-DEMO.
       AUTHOR. VALIDATION-PLATFORM.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TABLE.
           05  WS-ELEMENT      PIC 9(3) OCCURS 5 TIMES.
       01  WS-INDEX          PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
       01  WS-SUM            PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-LOGIC.
           DISPLAY "OCCURS DEMO STARTED".

           PERFORM VARYING WS-INDEX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-INDEX > 5
               COMPUTE WS-ELEMENT(WS-INDEX) = WS-INDEX * 10
               DISPLAY "ELEMENT(" WS-INDEX ")=" WS-ELEMENT(WS-INDEX)
           END-PERFORM.

           PERFORM VARYING WS-INDEX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-INDEX > 5
               ADD WS-ELEMENT(WS-INDEX) TO WS-SUM
           END-PERFORM.

           DISPLAY "SUM OF ELEMENTS=" WS-SUM.

           STOP RUN.